  scenarioTitle: 'Nigeria: Oil, Power & the Long Game'
  scenarioContext: "Africa's most populous nation teeters on a knife's edge. Oil
    revenues fund the federal budget, but global prices are volatile and domestic
    refining is weak. Tension on the Ghana border is rising \u2014 your generals
    want authorisation to mobilise, but an election is only three years away and
    the people are watching."
  scenarioPriorities: "\u2022 Secure the treasury \u2014 military mobilisation is
    expensive and the deficit is widening\n\u2022 Decide your posture on Ghana \u2014
    de-escalate diplomatically or prepare for war\n\u2022 Keep approval above 50%
    \u2014 an unpopular president doesn't survive election night"
