      effectiveness)\n\n\u2192 MILITARY \u2192 LOGISTICS \u2192 Top up ammo and fuel
      before advance\n\u2192 EVENTS \u2192 DECISIONS \u2192 Watch for field reports
      and respond\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014 CURRENT STATUS \u2014\u2014\u2014\nInfantry
      available: 20,000\nTanks: 193 \xB7 Fighters: 0\nTreasury: \u20A6999B \xB7 Mobilisation
      cost: $0.5B\nWorld Tension: 50/100\n\nNOTE: Troops not deployed within 2 months
